# Only this adapter's data/ (the linked datasets). Unanchored, `data/` also
# swallowed psi0/src/psi/data -- the package every trainer imports -- so the
# vendored checkout could not train until it was restored (2026-09-10).
/data/

# Upstream's physical-teleoperation CAD: 242 MB of STL meshes and rig assets for
# building and driving a real G1. MHBench is a simulator, nothing here opens
# them, and committing them would put a quarter of a gigabyte into every clone
# of this fork. psi0/UPSTREAM.md names the commit to fetch them back from.
psi0/real/assets/
psi0/real/teleop/

# Git LFS pointers, not content: the clone used GIT_LFS_SKIP_SMUDGE=1, so these
# 50 files came down as 130-byte stubs and committing them makes `git push`
# reject the whole branch ("missing or corrupt local objects"). They are the
# H-RDT baseline's precomputed RoboTwin2 language embeddings -- a different
# benchmark, inside a baseline Psi0 vendors, that nothing here loads. Fetch them
# with `git lfs pull` from the upstream commit if H-RDT is ever wanted.
psi0/src/h_rdt/inference/*/utils/lang_embeddings/
psi0/src/h_rdt/inference/*/*/utils/lang_embeddings/
